      "text": "Excercise  ----> $1DIEx-1\n========\n\nA student need to go to college using transport like Bus, \nCar or Bike.\n\nWAP in java such that transport is loosely coupled using\ndependency injection.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Excercise  ----> $1DIEx-1\n========\n\nA student need to go to college using transport like Bus, \nCar or Bike.\n\nWAP in java such that transport is loosely coupled using\ndependency injection.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
